  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude bona Claude Code be Anthropic, PBC ena trademark. Unreal Engine bona Epic Games be Epic Games, Inc. ena trademark. Blender be Blender Foundation ena trademark. Quake III Arena bona Elite Dangerous be edia tauanina ena trademark. Ladana ibounai be edia tauanina ena bona gaudia ia hakaua totona sibona ia gaukaralaia. Orion-81 be ia ibounai ai ia hebou lasi, ia heduru lasi o ia hamomokania lasi.",
